`ledger_shmem_recon()` Phase 1 snapshots cells under SHARED lock (lib.rs:646-664) — concurrent appliers can mutate the cells during the snapshot via atomic fetch_add. Phase 2 SPI runs OUTSIDE the lock entirely. Net: recon at-load returns possibly-mid-mutation snapshots.

